WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.540
You never have to type in this training.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:06.930
On your phone keyboard, tap the little microphone and just talk.

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:09.730
Say what you want, the same way you'd text a friend.

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:12.501
Try it now, then tap I did it.

